  "title": "When “Cheap” AI Gets Expensive",
  "summary": "DeepSeek warning users of a significant price increase is not a routine update but a market signal: demand for high-quality, low-cost tokens is outrunning available compute, and the model that competed on price now has enough adoption to raise it. Cheap AI does not stay cheap once the market confirms it is worth more.",
